# Core Project Rules

- Read `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, and relevant docs before coding.
- Keep changes small and scoped.
- Do not invent environment variables; check `.env.example`.
- Do not remove tests to make a build pass.
- Update `docs/PROJECT_STATUS.md` after meaningful changes.
- Update `docs/DECISIONS.md` after architectural decisions.
- Preserve protected files unless explicitly asked.
